<title>JORDAN: Jordanian gunman was army driver, colleague says.</title>
<headline>Jordanian gunman was army driver, colleague says.</headline>
<dateline>SHUNA, Jordan 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Jordanian soldier who killed seven Israelis on Thursday is a 26-year-old army driver who started his posting at the border area earlier this year, one of his army comrades said.</p>
<p>He identified the soldier as Ahmed Moussa, from the town of Adasiya, a few km (miles) north of the site of the shooting.</p>
</text>
